    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Embrace the darkness and rise as the Necro Blade,</u></strong><strong> a warrior bound by a soul pact with ancient powers to battle an unending nightmare! </strong> <br>In this rogue-like horror experience, every attempt to save your town plunges you deeper into a darker world, where death is only the beginning!  <br><strong> <br>Will you conquer the darkness, or will it consume your soul?   <br>Face your fears and make every life count in this relentless fight for survival!</strong><i> <br> <br> <br> </i>\u2022<i> Find magical potions to cast on enemies</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315670/extras/064369554ca0c5d90cbb40275213b811.avif?t=1734004421\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span><i> <br> </i>\u2022<i> Upgrade your weaponry and grow your strengths<br> </i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315670/extras/fc07c21a6535ed7c2225452ba8cbbca8.avif?t=1734004421\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span><i><br> <br> </i>\u2022<i> Use Necromancy to revive yourself into battle<br> </i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315670/extras/eea3a8939ac84f2ec404b356b142a139.avif?t=1734004421\" data-has-big width=800 height=158 /></span></p>",
